      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Keen on CIGNETTI (3) in the opener who looks best set up to win. He'd shown ability in two runs last time in but has come back better, bolting in first up in fast time with huge margins back behind. Will run out a strong 1500m no problem and Shinn sticks from a soft gate. LEPOLO (4) was well backed and bolted in on debut at Ballarat Synthetic, scoring by 3.5 lengths. Didn't beat much and the time was okay without being great but clearly looks talented and will improve. UTOPIC FUTURE (5) was a narrow winner on debut at Pakenham Synthetic and is open to improvement. KO PHANGAN (1) is off 7 weeks but won the Byerley Hcp nicely when last seen, gives away weight and fitness though.",
